      "content": "Wait, what? I'm not sure I follow the \"goblins\" thing. I'm just trying to get a clear scientific understanding of the physics here for my report. \n\nCan we drop the analogies and just stick to the actual oceanographic mechanics? Also, regarding those spikes I mentioned—if the temperature and salinity aren't correlating like they should, could that be a sign of sensor interference or just really erratic environmental flux?",
